# Office Assets Management System

The Office Assets Management System is a web-based application developed using Laravel to manage office assets efficiently.  
It helps organizations track assets, categories, employees, and asset assignments in a structured and secure way.

🚀 Features

- Admin Authentication (Laravel Breeze)
- Asset Management (Add, Edit, Delete, View)
- Asset Categories Management (Electronics, Furniture, Housekeeping, etc.)
- Employee Management
- Asset Assignment & Tracking
- Asset Status Tracking (Available, Assigned, Damaged, Under Repair)
- Dashboard with Statistics
- Recent Assets, Assignments, and Employees View
- Secure CRUD Operations
- Responsive UI using Tailwind CSS

🛠️ Technologies Used

- Backend:Laravel 10+
- Frontend:Blade Templates, Tailwind CSS
- Authentication:Laravel Breeze
- Database:MySQL
- Version Control:Git & GitHub

📂 Project Modules

1. Assets
- Asset Name
- Serial Number
- Category
- Status (Available, Assigned, Damaged, Under Repair)
- Condition
- Created & Updated Records

2. Categories
- Electronics
- Furniture
- Housekeeping
- IT Equipment
- Other Office Assets

3. Employees
- Employee Name
- Employee ID
- Department
- Position
- Status (Active, On Leave, Inactive)

4. Assignments
- Asset Assignment to Employees
- Assignment Date
- Active / Inactive Assignment Tracking

#📊 Dashboard Overview

- Total Assets
- Assigned Assets
- Available Assets
- Damaged Assets
- Total Employees
- Total Categories
- Recent Assets
- Recent Assignments
- Recent Employees
- Assets by Status Visualization
